  "details": "When opening an avatar search world (prismic's, AWB) on the 12 Pro Max, the world will load and after a split second immediately then cause the phone's screen to flicker indefinitely until the app is force closed. Movement controls and PTT are still response (as seen by an accompanying user) but completely unplayable on the main user's end.\n\niOS Version is 18.6.2\n\n1. Open VRChat on iOS (12 Pro Max)\n\n2. Go to Prismic's search or AWB\n\n3. Screen will begin flickering rapidly and will soft lock the app, requiring full restart.",
